  * [MITRE, CWE-798](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/798.html) \- Use of Hard-coded Credentials 
  * [CERT, MSC03-J.](https://wiki.sei.cmu.edu/confluence/x/OjdGBQ) \- Never hard code sensitive information

 

